### Dung voi IntelliJ HTTP Client hoac VS Code REST Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@tenantId = thay-bang-id-tra-ve

### 1. Tao tenant -> bat dau workflow onboarding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Corp",
  "adminEmail": "admin@acme.io",
  "plan": "PRO"
}

### 2. Danh sach tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants

### 3. Trang thai tenant (doc tu DB H2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}

### 4. Timeline cac lan chuyen trang thai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/events

### 5. Trang thai doc truc tiep tu workflow (Temporal query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/workflow-state

### 6a. WAITING_APPROVAL -> approve (tiep tuc flow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "actor": "ops-team" }

### 6b. WAITING_APPROVAL -> reject (rollback + FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thong tin khong hop le" }

### 7a. WAITING_RETRY -> chay lai buoc bi loi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/retry

### 7b. WAITING_RETRY -> huy (rollback + FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/abort
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Khong xu ly duoc" }
